      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Niggas want they merit (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Missing cash flow, so they want some credit (Ah, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Ah-ha, nigga, you should be embarrassed (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You ain't the only nigga that be in Paris (Ah, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "This shit dead, no need for paramedics (Nah)",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You ain't where you at in your head, shit is apparent (Oh, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You ain't head nigga 'round here, you ain't the sheriff (Word)",
          "rhyme": "if",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You ain't seeing shit how it is, get him some carrots",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Let me say this shit right here so niggas hear it (Ah)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Everything involved in your life is fuckin' pathetic (Ah)",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Tyler got the talent, Tyler got the vision (Oh)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Tyler that nigga, so really you can't compare us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Why you fill with terror whenever you in my presence? (Why?)",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Is it 'cause we look just alike and niggas said it? (Why?)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I will never lose any sleep, I'll never sweat it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And I'll always be ahead of you, nigga, don't you forget it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABACDEFGCHIJGGG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABAACADAAEFCAAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Let me show you punk motherfuckers what I know (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "See, I know, I'm the guy that took a chance like Chicago (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So I wind, I can do this shit with my eyes closed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Can't tell the difference like Michael's vitiligo, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "There he go again (Woo)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "They tried to boycott him, but he didn't dim (Oh, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He started from the bottom and they want the fall-off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Like he skipped autumn and spring some more wins",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Look, you tell me I can't, I tell you I can (Da-da, da-da, da-da)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You tell me I can't, I do it again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Reversin' the job, like blowin' a fan (Da-da, da-da, da-da)",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "No matter which way you look at it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Understand, it's plugged in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "You tell me it's nine lives, I'm pushin' it up ten",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You tell me to do five, I'm pushin' a buck ten",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I might just cut off the brakes and aim for the sidelines (Ahhh)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "For you nothin'-ass niggas that's screamin' out \"Fuck him,\" fuck them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFDGDHIJKKJL",
